Il Dispaccio – Roundcube skin
==============================

This repository contains parts under different licences.

1. dispaccio/  (the skin: templates, LESS sources, compiled CSS, images, localization, meta.json,
   watermark.html, thumbnail.png), except dispaccio/fonts/*.woff2
   Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC BY-SA 3.0)
   Full text: LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-3.0.txt  –  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

   The skin is an adaptation of Roundcube's "Elastic" skin (© The Roundcube Dev Team,
   design and code by Aleksander Machniak), which is distributed under CC BY-SA 3.0.
   In particular dispaccio/templates/includes/layout.html is a modified copy of Elastic's
   templates/includes/layout.html, and the LESS imports and overrides Elastic's sources.
   Elastic itself is not redistributed here; it must be installed alongside (it ships with Roundcube).

2. plugins/startup_folder/  (optional Roundcube plugin)
   Licence: GNU General Public License v3.0 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later)
   Full text: LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt

3. dispaccio/fonts/*.woff2
   - JetBrains Mono – © 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors – SIL Open Font License 1.1
     (dispaccio/fonts/OFL-JetBrainsMono.txt)
   - Fraunces – © 2020 The Fraunces Project Authors – SIL Open Font License 1.1
     (dispaccio/fonts/OFL-Fraunces.txt)
   The woff2 subsets come from the Fontsource packages @fontsource-variable/jetbrains-mono and
   @fontsource-variable/fraunces.

4. screenshots/ and README.md – CC BY-SA 3.0, like the skin. The mail shown in the screenshots
   is fictitious sample data.

Roundcube is a trademark of the Roundcube project; this skin is not an official Roundcube product.
